# Git commits

- Follow [Conventional Commits](./CONTRIBUTING.md): `type(scope): summary`
- Common types: `feat`, `fix`, `perf`, `test`, `ci`, `docs`, `chore`, `refactor`
- Summary in imperative mood; keep the first line concise
- **Never** add `Co-authored-by:` (or similar trailer) for Cursor or any AI agent
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `.m2/`
